      "date": "2026-01-20T05:27:00.000Z",
      "title": "Skyline Ventures India Limited Appoints Kanukollu Janaki Rama Lakshmana Rao as Company Secretary and Compliance Officer, Effective January 20, 2026",
      "body": "Skyline Ventures India Limited at the meeting held on 20 January 2026 approved the appointment of Mr. Kanukollu Janaki Rama Lakshmana Rao (M.No:A33703) as the Company Secretary and Compliance Officer of the Company with immediate effect. The appointment was made pursuant to Section 203 and all other relevant provisions of Companies Act, 2013 and SEBI Listing Regulations. Mr. Kanukollu Janaki Rama Lakshmana Rao is an accomplished Legal and Compliance Counsel with over 25+ years of expertise in contract law, regulatory compliance, vendor negotiations, and corporate governance. He is specialized in international laws, contract law and gained experience in various cross border assignments. He is adept at supporting cross-border legal operations, drafting and reviewing commercial contracts, and",
