      "body": "Skyline Ventures India Limited announced that Mr. Nikshit Hemendra Shah (DIN: 07910462) has tendered his resignation as Director (Independent) of Skyline Ventures India Limited with effect from December 19, 2025 due to conflicts between management and shareholders. These unwanted conflicts and pressures have impaired smooth functioning of Board in recent times.",
